  "scope": {
    "zh": "“女性气质能量”在本版是一个可自由使用的文化表达标题，下面的四组名称和题目是本站原创观察入口，不是四种普世女性原型，也不借WHO验证题本。性别规范随文化和时间变化；表达偏好不能判定生理性别、性别认同、性取向、激素、女性程度或人生价值。亲昵、鲜明、诗意与清楚主张不专属于女性，任何人都不必符合其中一种。题本不测魅力、他人的反应、共情或领导能力、心理健康、职业或关系适配，不复刻JobCannon的16题两轴原型或IDRlabs的24题明暗二分。不设高低好坏，不把照护劳动、顺从、身体外形或取悦别人当女性义务；四组均分也没有常模、效度或跨语言等价证明。",
    "en": "Feminine energy is used here as an optional cultural expression title. The four names and items are original observation entrances, not four universal female archetypes or a WHO-validated bank. Gender norms vary across cultures and time. Expression preferences establish no biological sex, gender identity, sexual orientation, hormones, degree of femininity or human worth. Warmth, flair, poetry and clear preferences belong to no single gender, and nobody must fit one. This bank assesses no charm, other people’s responses, empathy, leadership, mental health, career or relationship fit. It replicates neither JobCannon’s sixteen-item two-axis archetypes nor IDRlabs’ twenty-four-item light/dark split. There is no good or bad ranking, and care labour, compliance, body shape or pleasing others is no feminine obligation. Means have no established norms, validity or cross-language equivalence."
  },
  "instructions": {
    "zh": "回想过去四周，在你自己愿意表达、且有相应机会的普通小场面中，这些具体做法出现得多频繁。只评自己的做法，不猜别人是否被吸引、尊重你或如何评价你的性别。用1—5记录频率；没有相关经历、情境不适合或无法判断，请选“未经历／无法判断”，不按最低频率代填。20项均需选择，其中四组各5项、全部正向记录；没有反向、权重或隐藏主副型。每组至少3项有效才显示本组均分，均分为有效频率加总除以有效项数、保留一位小数；不足时明确资料不足，不补零。四组分别呈现，不加总成女性程度、能量百分比或人格等级，也不从近分判定固定原型。任何性别都可以使用；无需身体、照片、性取向、关系经历或身份信息。题目不合适可停止，四份公开完整读法仍免费。",
    "en": "Think about the past four weeks and ordinary situations in which you wanted to express yourself and had the relevant opportunity. Rate your own actions, not whether others were attracted, respected you or judged your gender. Record frequency from one to five. Choose Not experienced / cannot judge when there was no relevant experience, the setting did not fit or you cannot judge; do not substitute the lowest frequency. All twenty items need a choice. Four groups have five items each, all positively keyed, without reversals, weights or hidden primary and secondary types. A group needs at least three rated items for its mean: sum the rated frequencies, divide by rated items and round to one decimal. Otherwise information is insufficient, not zero. Groups stay separate without a femininity total, energy percentage or personality grade, and close means assign no fixed archetype. People of any gender can use this. Provide no body, photograph, sexual orientation, relationship history or identity information. Leave if the questions do not fit; all four public full guides remain free."
  },
